ing of cs go but what hunden was  certainly was a massive influence on  danish cs go he was considered one of  the great minds of the region and  respected by many of his peers listen i  don't just host videos i primarily write  them so when i was researching to write  the story of glaive and read an article  in dot esports where glaive credited  hunden with helping both himself and msl  become great in-game leaders  that's high praise and i knew i had to  talk to him to know exactly  how that happened furthermore a report  from luis mira then working for hltv in  july 2021 cited sources that claimed  hunden was a front-runner to become the  coach of astralis after sonic's contract  expired i guess what i'm trying to say  is that it's no surprise that hunden was  trusted by his players he was trusted by  most players in his region hunton had  quite a big status in the danish scene  before joining heroic he was like kind  of the godfather of danishes like he was  the guy that everyone was talking about  i'm not trying to cover the three heroic  players for staying quiet after that  astralis match  they made that decision but i at least  understand why they hesitated and with  all of this in the rearview mirror i  hope they can realize that the decision  that damaged hunden's career was his own  and if they could have all understood  that back then they could have spared  themselves a lot of anguish  i remember like i'm pretty sure like  when the when the coaching bug was first  discovered right  they had like two people  going through everything and it's like  thousands of matches  like like there's a lot to keep on top  of and nobody you know then no or even a  super well-funded organization  would have trouble  keeping track of all of it and trying to  stay on top of cheating i mean esic also  is responsible um for administering uh  drug tests at events um it's wild to  think about and it's not something that  you see in  you know like like you know in sports a  franchise league carries out its own  drug test and carries out its own  investigations if it must for whatever  reason right so  um  it's it's just it's so difficult and big  respect to the guys at esic

